  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water and Sanitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWF is the only african project preparation facility entirely focused on water and sanitation positioned to work in this context. The AWF provides grants and technical assistance to support the preparation and implementation of water infrastructure projects and water management measures throughout africa, thereby contributing to attainment of the africa water vision 2025 (awv 2025), as well as water- related sdgs.</narrative>
  </description>
